      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The Layer 5 recommended label is shown as a suggestion, already marked \u201cnot a verdict\u201d.\nThey can still inspect publication risk, corroboration, disagreements, and empty tools.\nThey may pick a different label from the recommendation. That is the point.",
      "originalText": "The Layer 5 recommended label is shown as a suggestion, already marked \u201cnot a verdict\u201d.\n\nThey can still inspect publication risk, corroboration, disagreements, and empty tools.\n\nThey may pick a different label from the recommendation. That is the point.",
