      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "No LLM is called. Engine: dashboard (no model).\nProceed is blocked \u2014 \u201csubmit an editorial decision to continue\u201d.\nRe-run is blocked \u2014 \u201ceditorial decision cannot be generated by the system\u201d.\nThe pipeline cannot skip this human.",
      "originalText": "No LLM is called. Engine: dashboard (no model).\n\nProceed is blocked \u2014 \u201csubmit an editorial decision to continue\u201d.\nRe-run is blocked \u2014 \u201ceditorial decision cannot be generated by the system\u201d.\n\nThe pipeline cannot skip this human.",
